        "Description": "Good evening, 47!\r\r Your mission takes place in Cuba, where a group of rogue military operatives, led by Leo Kazantsev, is planning a covert arms deal that could destabilize the region. Alongside him are his trusted lieutenants: Edward Evdokimov, Evan Gomez, and Longin Nowakowski. Each of them has played a role in ensuring this operation runs smoothly, and their removal will send a clear message to those who seek to profit from chaos.\r\rEliminate all four using a pistol.\r\rGood Luck 47!",
